Included in this directory are:

- the original ZMODEM documentation: zmodem-forsberg.txt
  It was written by the protocols inventor Chuck Forsberg, and last 
  changed in 1988. It is partially out of date, but contains a wealth
  of historical information, for example the considerations leading to
  the protocol.

- a shorter ZMODEM documentation: zmodem-zmtx-zmrx.txt
  Written by Jacques Mattheij, the author of the zmtx-zmrx suite.
  It was written in 1994, and is also out of date.

- my own ZMODEM documentation: zmodem-current.txt
  It was written in 2026.
  I marked many features as deprecated, because they are either
  obsolete or should not be used in todays environment. I also 
  documented common extension.

- zmodemsnif.txt, the only documentation of the ZMODEM sniffer i
  use.

